<title>NEW ZEALAND: W&amp;K offer for NZ Rural Props unconditional.</title>
<headline>W&amp;K offer for NZ Rural Props unconditional.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Williams and Kettle said on Wednesday that the takeover offer for all of the shares in NZ Rural Properties Ltd had been declared to be unconditional.</p>
<p>It had 9,866,810 of the shares in NPR, 56.6 percent of the shares. -- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
